Feature: Pine Circle member prices

  @member @secrets
  Scenario: Signing in shows member prices on the rooms page
    StepSet Search for a two-night stay
    When I record the Garden Queen nightly price as "guest price"
    And I click "Sign in for member prices"
    StepSet Sign in as the member
    Then "guest price" should differ from the Garden Queen nightly price
    And the Garden Queen should show the member price "€157.25"
    And I should see "Member prices applied"

  @member @negative
  Scenario: A wrong password is refused
    Given I open the Haven & Pine home page
    When I click "Sign in" in the header
    And I sign in with email "{data:member.email}" and password "not-the-password"
    Then I should see "The email or password is incorrect."
